     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hello,\r\nAntonio!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I have\r\n2-node cluster of Hadoop 1.2.0 under Cygwin on Windows 8 (2 VirtualBox’s\r\nmachines).</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/--fE3L08i2so/VQR7KC3nWkI/AAAAAAAAAVw/oqDpY6JDoSE/s1600/slave.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/--fE3L08i2so/VQR7KC3nWkI/AAAAAAAAAVw/oqDpY6JDoSE/s1600/slave.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490948609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0BKSfFqTZhBLEw6yvMJ5ty\"></a><a style=\"clear:right;margin-bottom:1em;float:right;margin-left:1em\" href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PVpt9XEBgq0/VQR7aPtmTyI/AAAAAAAAAWI/kVIl50qKZX8/s1600/master2.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PVpt9XEBgq0/VQR7aPtmTyI/AAAAAAAAAWI/kVIl50qKZX8/s1600/master2.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490948609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_ves3NteB8cR3rKwRG-Eq\"></a><a style=\"clear:right;margin-bottom:1em;float:right;margin-left:1em\" href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-hXZL9lOp7vg/VQR7V4ziw8I/AAAAAAAAAWA/LThcfTgZ9aI/s1600/master1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-hXZL9lOp7vg/VQR7V4ziw8I/AAAAAAAAAWA/LThcfTgZ9aI/s1600/master1.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490948609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Yi6o1liJ5FFalKfxC_sZc\"></a><a style=\"clear:right;margin-bottom:1em;float:right;margin-left:1em\" href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-CtKATXx5Koc/VQR7pSfjtJI/AAAAAAAAAWQ/-63tWlKU3ww/s1600/master3.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-CtKATXx5Koc/VQR7pSfjtJI/AAAAAAAAAWQ/-63tWlKU3ww/s1600/master3.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490948609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2oZ6eWpXGmYmC3eJxQrr-P\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-CtKATXx5Koc/VQR7pSfjtJI/AAAAAAAAAWQ/-63tWlKU3ww/s200/master3.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"150\" width=\"200\"></a><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-hXZL9lOp7vg/VQR7V4ziw8I/AAAAAAAAAWA/LThcfTgZ9aI/s200/master1.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"150\" width=\"200\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PVpt9XEBgq0/VQR7aPtmTyI/AAAAAAAAAWI/kVIl50qKZX8/s200/master2.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"150\" width=\"200\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/--fE3L08i2so/VQR7KC3nWkI/AAAAAAAAAVw/oqDpY6JDoSE/s200/slave.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"150\" width=\"200\"></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">I\r\ndecided to try rmr2 and rhdfs for Windows on 2-node cluster. On master machine I installed\r\nrmr2_3.3.1 and rhdfs_1.0.8 for Windows:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">install.packages(\r\nc(&#39;RJSONIO&#39;, &#39;itertools&#39;, &#39;digest&#39;, &#39;Rcpp&#39;, &#39;functional&#39;, &#39;plyr&#39;, &#39;stringr&#39;,\r\n&#39;reshape2&#39;, &#39;caTools&#39;, &#39;rJava&#39;, &#39;plyr&#39;, &#39;RCurl&#39;,<span>  </span>&#39;httr&#39;,&#39;devtools&#39;,&#39;R.methodsS3&#39;,&#39;hydroPSO&#39;,\r\n&#39;bitops&#39;, &#39;dplyr&#39;, &#39;lazyeval&#39;, &#39;rjson&#39;),\r\nrepos=&#39;<a href=\"http://cran.revolutionanalytics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.revolutionanalytics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490948609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1L-nlPppjCO3hzm8hzY2hZ\">http://cran.revolutionanalytics.com</a>&#39;)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">install.packages(&quot;C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\Downloads\\\\rmr2_3.3.1.zip&quot;,repos=NULL,\r\ntype=&quot;source&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">install.packages(&quot;C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\Downloads\\\\rhdfs_1.0.8.zip&quot;,repos=NULL,\r\ntype=&quot;source&quot;)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">After this,\r\nI setup system environments and entered commands for test of rmr2 and rhdfs:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sys.setenv(&quot;HADOOP_HOME&quot;=&quot;C:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sys.setenv(&quot;HADOOP_CMD&quot;=&quot;C:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/bin/hadoop&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sys.setenv(&quot;HADOOP_STREAMING&quot;=&quot;C:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/contrib/streaming/hadoop-streaming-1.2.0.jar&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sys.setenv(&quot;HADOOP_CONF&quot;=&quot;C:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/etc/hadoop/conf&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sys.setenv(JAVA_HOME=&#39;C:/java/jre&#39;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">library(rmr2)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"></span></p><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Please review your hadoop settings. See help(hadoop.settings)</span></pre><p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">library(rJava)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">library(rhdfs)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"></span></p><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">HADOOP_CMD=C:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/bin/hadoop\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\nBe sure to run hdfs.init()<br><br></span></pre><p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">But on command\r\n“hdfs.init()” the error was found:</span></p><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in system(command, intern = TRUE) : \r\n  &#39;C:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/bin/hadoop&#39; not found</span></pre></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Although the file &#39;hadoop&#39; is in his folder.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Also I\r\ntried to test “rmr2” and got erorrs too:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; small.ints = 1:1000</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; small.int.path = to.dfs(1:1000)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">Warning message:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">running command\r\n&#39;C:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/bin/hadoop jar\r\nC:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/contrib/streaming/hadoop-streaming-1.2.0.jar\r\nloadtb /tmp/fileda05f1a6041 &lt; /cygwin64/tmp/Rtmp0ud1Tb/fileda0608f6bc&#39; had\r\nstatus 127 </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; out = mapreduce(input = small.int.path, map = function(k,v) keyval(v,\r\nv^2))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">Error in mr(map = map, reduce = reduce, combine =\r\ncombine, vectorized.reduce,<span>  </span>: </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>hadoop\r\nstreaming failed with error code 127</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">In addition: Warning message:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">running command\r\n&#39;C:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/bin/hadoop jar\r\nC:/cygwin64/usr/local/hadoop-1.2.0/contrib/streaming/hadoop-streaming-1.2.0.jar<span>   </span>-D<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;stream.map.input=typedbytes&quot;<span>     </span>-D<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;stream.map.output=typedbytes&quot;<span>     </span>-D<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;stream.reduce.input=typedbytes&quot;<span>     </span>-D<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;stream.reduce.output=typedbytes&quot;<span>     </span>-D<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;mapred.reduce.tasks=0&quot;<span>    \r\n</span>-D<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;mapreduce.map.java.opts=-Xmx400M&quot;<span>     </span>-D<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;mapreduce.reduce.java.opts=-Xmx400M&quot;<span>     </span>-files<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;/cygwin64/tmp/Rtmp0ud1Tb/rmr-local-envda0bea110a,/cygwin64/tmp/Rtmp0ud1Tb/rmr-global-envda068cd21c0,/cygwin64/tmp/Rtmp0ud1Tb/rmr-streaming-mapda071e5662d&quot;<span>     </span>-input<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;/tmp/fileda05f1a6041&quot;<span>    \r\n</span>-output<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;/tmp/fileda07bc03870&quot;<span>    \r\n</span>-mapper<span>     </span>&quot;Rscript\r\n--vanilla ./rmr-streaming-mapda071e5662d&quot;<span>       </span>-inputformat<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;org.apache.hadoop.streaming.AutoInputFormat&quot;<span>     </span>-outputformat<span>    \r\n</span>&quot;org.apache.hadoop.mapred.SequenceFileOutputFormat&quot;<span>   </span>2&gt;&amp;1&#39; had status 127 </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; df = from.dfs(out)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\">Error in to.dfs.path(input) : object &#39;out&#39; not found</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">May you prompt about existing of probability of RHadoop&#39;s package&#39;s installing on Hadoop&#39;s cluster + Cygwin + Windows 8? <br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Maybe, the cause of errors is Hadoop&#39;s version or the incompatibility of Windows rmr2&#39;s and rhdfs&#39;s packages with Cygwin or Windows&#39;s version.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">I&#39;ll be thankful for your response.<br><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:120px;text-align:right\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
